# A path `let` and a reader call plan as scans of the source they name.
mode: explain
schema: 'x.csv'(a: long, b: string)
---- query
let p = 'x.csv';
from p | where a > 1;
from read_csv(p, delimiter = ';') | take 1
---- expected
Filter: a > 1
  Scan: 'x.csv' (a: long, b: string)

Limit: 1
  Scan: read_csv('x.csv', delimiter = ';') (a: long, b: string)
